      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0",
      "artist": "Wufuy",
      "description": "The ERISAT logo features a notable design that incorporates several key elements.\nAt the center of the logo is a gold-colored circle depicting the map of Eritrea. This represents the organization's connection to Eritrea and its commitment to serving the Eritrean community.\nA satellite dish icon, also in gold color, is depicted within the map of Eritrea. This symbolizes the organization's focus on satellite broadcasting and its aim to provide universal access to high-quality content for Eritreans both inside and outside of Eritrea.\nThe organization's name, \"ERISAT,\" is written in capital letters, using a gold-colored font that harmonizes with the other elements in the logo. This caption serves to identify the organization and its purpose.\n\nOverall, the logo's design signifies ERISAT's dedication to connecting Eritreans, bridging the information gap, and disseminating accurate and empowering content through satellite television.",
      "dateCreated": "2023-05-31",
